VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'space and need to urgently free up some room, then you only need to run that big full sweep about once a month. But the optimizer option, which flashes caches and memory as well, is worth running on'

[04:41] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'a more regular basis. I recommend weekly. The uninstall option analyzes every app on your Mac and presents them in a list ordered by default by age, with the oldest apps sitting at the top.'

